        <area aac="QLD_FA004" description="South Queensland" type="sub-region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-11-04T17:00:00+10:00" end-time-local="2026-11-09T00:00:00+10:00" start-time-utc="2026-11-04T07:00:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-08T14:00:00Z">
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A trough lies just inland of the Central Queensland coast, strengthening northerly winds ahead of it across the waters. A separate trough and southeasterly change extending from a low in the Tasman Sea will move north across the Gold Coast waters late on Thursday, and into Central Queensland waters on Friday.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
